      "message_parsed": "Под tp2 работать будет же?<br />\nPS Такое в bbcode.php подойдёт?<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"php\">---открываем bbcode.php\n \n---ищем\n \n// Image\n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;img&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &lt;var class=&quot;postImg&quot; title=&quot;$1&quot;&gt;&amp;#10;&lt;/var&gt;\nHTML;\n \n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;img_aligned&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &lt;var class=&quot;postImg postImgAligned img-\\\\1&quot; title=&quot;\\\\2&quot;&gt;&amp;#10;&lt;/var&gt;\nHTML;\n \n---после вставляем\n \n//Thumb\n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;thumb&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &lt;a href=&quot;\\\\1&quot; rel=&quot;topic&quot; class=&quot;zoom&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;\\\\1&quot; class=&quot;thumb&quot; style=&quot;max-width:350px; max-height:260px;&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\nHTML;\n \n$bbcode_tpl[&#039;thumb_aligned&#039;] = &lt;&lt;&lt;HTML\n    &lt;a href=&quot;\\\\2&quot; rel=&quot;topic&quot; class=&quot;zoom&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;\\\\2&quot; class=&quot;thumb&quot; style=&quot;max-width:350px; max-height:260px;&quot; align=&quot;\\\\1&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;\nHTML;\n \n---ищем\n \n            &quot;#\\[img\\]($img_url_exp)\\[/img\\]#isu&quot;                    =&gt; $tpl[&#039;img&#039;],\n            &quot;#\\[img=(left|right)\\]($img_url_exp)\\[/img\\]\\s*#isu&quot;    =&gt; $tpl[&#039;img_aligned&#039;],\n \n \n---после вставлем\n \n            &quot;#\\[thumb\\]($img_url_exp)\\[/thumb\\]\\s*#i&quot;            =&gt; $tpl[&#039;thumb&#039;],\n            &quot;#\\[thumb=(left|right)\\]($img_url_exp)\\[/thumb\\]\\s*#i&quot; =&gt; $tpl[&#039;thumb_aligned&#039;],\n            &quot;#\\[url=($img_url_exp)\\](.*?)\\[/url\\]#isu&quot;            =&gt; &#039;&lt;a href=&quot;$1&quot; rel=&quot;topic&quot; class=&quot;zoom&quot;&gt;$3&lt;/a&gt;&#039;,</pre>",
